    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "When I was younger, I never heard about anybody going to therapy unless they were a war veteran or victim of some horrific crime.\n\nAnd people were saner and better regulated back then.\n\nI'm not convinced modern therapy helps most people. The opposite is possible.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2037407001416696181",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-27T05:50:56+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
