    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "The storms have cleared... Back to the studio.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2037489120155738602",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-27T11:17:15+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "If people shared and amplified the stuff they like MORE than they shared and amplified the stuff they dislike, the world would look very different.\n\n(and so would social media)",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2037461842210029619",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-27T09:28:52+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "And just like that, nobody cares about the Epstein files anymore.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2037232186072719521",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-26T18:16:17+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Been spending lots of amazing days with my family recently. Love love love.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2037220212328759778",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-26T17:28:42+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "A lot of what people blame on 'algorithms' should really be blamed on human nature.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2037073381112373358",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-26T07:45:15+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "3 years ago, my nephew was born very prematurely at a weight of only 850 grams (1.87lbs)...\n\nToday, we celebrated his 3rd birthday. We thank God for his life and good health! \ud83d\udc9c",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2036871978741580216",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-25T18:24:57+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Based on who the mainstream media has tried to demonise and cancel over the past decade, it seems they have a problem with ANY man who effectively communicates with young men.\n\nThe core message isn't really the issue. The audience demographic is.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2036746078767456353",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-25T10:04:40+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "It annoys me when people call young adults 'kids'.\n\nA 20 year old is not a 'kid'. It's demeaning and a sign of how low societal expectations have fallen.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2036853575335522382",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-25T17:11:49+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "The average person's political opinions are purely based on vibes and what their peers think.\n\nYou may not like it, but it's true.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2036841220769796221",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-25T16:22:44+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
